+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns a new value, leaving the inputs unchanged. Object patches recursively merge members;
+members set to `null` are removed. A non-object patch replaces the entire target.
+
